  "summary": "Payload: Uploaded XML files could execute same-origin JavaScript",
  "details": "### Impact\nUnder certain local upload configurations, an uploaded XML file and stylesheet could execute JavaScript in the Payload origin when a logged-in user opens the file.\n\nYou are affected if:\n- You accept XML uploads (accepted by default).\n\n### Patches\nUsers should upgrade Payload packages to `>= 3.90.0` or `>= 4.0.0-canary.34`.\n\n### Workarounds\nDisallow XML/XSL uploads.",
